bool   nd_on   = input.bool(true, "New Day Opening Gap", group=GND, display=display.none,
    tooltip="The 16:59 close to the 18:00 open, Monday through Thursday (New York time). Sunday's open is the NWOG, so the latest NDOG (Thursday's) stays through Monday's session. Quarter and mid levels are measured from the open toward the prior close, so 25% means the gap is a quarter filled. The gap stays until the next one opens; it has no takes. Shown on 4-hour and lower charts.")
